---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="Amazon Associates affiliate disclosure for TheBudgetAesthetic.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-charcoal mb-8">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <div class="glass rounded-3xl p-8 prose prose-aesthetic max-w-none">
      <p>TheBudgetAesthetic is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Associates Program</strong>, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.in and Amazon.com.</p>
      <p>When you click on product links and make a purchase, TheBudgetAesthetic may earn a small commission at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>. Affiliate links are marked with "Check Price on Amazon" buttons throughout this site.</p>
      <p>All product recommendations are based on genuine research and editorial judgement. We never accept payment for editorial coverage.</p>
      <p>For India visitors, links redirect to Amazon.in with an India Associates tag. For all other regions, links redirect to Amazon.com.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/60">Last updated: {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
